<catalogue id="e373-832b-776c-ecf1" name="French Ordonnance" revision="5" battleScribeVersion="2.03" authorName="Jono Firth" authorUrl="https://www.greatescapegames.co.uk/uploads/images/wysiwyg/home-shortcuts/coe/medieval/French_Ordonnance_May_11th_2012.pdf" library="false" gameSystemId="c749-87c2-0d4a-5e29" gameSystemRevision="12" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema">
  <readme>This army list covers the reforms of Charles VII. Historical enemies include Medieval Germans, Medieval Spanish, Burgundians, 100 Years’ War and War of the Roses English. A French Ordonnance army must include a general and at least one unit of Ordannance Men-at-arms and one unit of Ordonnance Longbowmen. </readme>
